                </div>
                <div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;background:var(--green);color:white;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.75rem;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid white;" onclick="document.getElementById('avatar-file-input').click()">📷</div>
